  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Lonely Steel Sheet Flyer**: rare: 8 archived performances [6]\n- **It's Got Old**: rare: 9 archived performances [6]\n- **bluegrass improv**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **Presumptuous**: rare: 9 archived performances [6]\n- **Most Of What I Like**: rare: 10 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2023-06-04.dankski** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 119 min; rated 3/5 by 1 [1]\n- **kglw2024-06-04.FLAC.bootleggermix**: soundboard; 16 songs; 119 min [3]\n- **kglw2023-06-04.dank**: source not stated; 17 songs; 119 min [2]\n- **kglw2023-06-04.danktrix**: matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 16 songs; 119 min [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The performance was a fully acoustic show [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2023-06-04.dankski**: taped by DankskiVision; transferred by DankskiVision; source: Zoom Q8n-4k Shotgun 24/48 [1]\n- **kglw2024-06-04.FLAC.bootleggermix**: taped by Sam Joseph, Nico Wilson, Gaspard Demulemeester and Joseph Santarpia; source: SBD [3]. Also: Stu Mackenzie and Sam Joseph handled the mixing process [3]\n- **kglw2023-06-04.dank**: taped by DankskiVision; transferred by DankskiVision; source: Zoom H6 xy cap 24/48 [2]\n- **kglw2023-06-04.danktrix**: taped by DankskiVision; transferred by TeddyDunski; source: Zoom Matrix [4]",
